{"sha": "edc541fcda74d52d3f834065c1c650083c4b94d3136ffbb142c6104e5f1663c2", "body": ["\\textbf{6.} $\\mathcal{E} = Ri + u$，其中 $i = C\\,du/dt$：", "$RC\\,du/dt + u = \\mathcal{E}$.", "", "\\textbf{7.} $du/dt = (\\mathcal{E}/RC)e^{-t/RC}$：", "$\\mathcal{E}e^{-t/RC} + \\mathcal{E}(1 - e^{-t/RC}) = \\mathcal{E}$", "对所有 $t$ 都成立，且 $u(0) = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\tau = RC = 10^3 \\times 8.0\\times10^{-4} = \\qty{0.80}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 当 $3\\tau = \\qty{2.4}{s}$ 时，$u = 0.95 \\times 300 =", "\\qty{285}{V}$ --- 两秒的嗡嗡声。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $I_0 = \\mathcal{E}/R = \\qty{0.30}{A}$；随 $u$ 升高，", "余下的 $\\mathcal{E} - u$ 加在 $R$ 上，随之减小，故 $i = (\\mathcal{E}-u)/R$", "逐渐衰减至零。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $u(t) = U_0\\,e^{-t/\\tau'}$，其中 $\\tau' = R_f C =", "0.50 \\times 8.0\\times10^{-4} = \\qty{0.40}{ms}$。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $I_0 = U_0/R_f = 300/0.50 = \\qty{600}{A}$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $P_0 = U_0 I_0 = 300 \\times 600 = \\qty{180}{kW}$ --- 约为", "$80$ 只电热水壶同时工作的功率。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 时长 $3\\tau' = \\qty{1.2}{ms}$；平均功率", "$\\approx 36/1.2\\times10^{-3} = \\qty{30}{kW}$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $2.4/1.2\\times10^{-3} = 2000$。仅电阻发生了变化", "（接入 \\qty{1.0}{k\\ohm}，改为 \\qty{0.50}{\\ohm}）：一个功率杠杆。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $C = 2E_C/U_0^2 = 400/1500^2 \\approx \\qty{1.8e-4}{F} =", "\\qty{180}{\\micro F}$.", "", "\\textbf{17.} $q = CU_0 = 1.78\\times10^{-4} \\times 1500 \\approx", "\\qty{0.27}{C}$.", "", "\\textbf{18.} $\\tau = 50 \\times 1.78\\times10^{-4} \\approx \\qty{8.9}{ms}$,", "时长 $3\\tau \\approx \\qty{27}{ms}$ --- 约为闪光时长的二十倍。", "", "\\textbf{19.} $I_0 = 1500/50 = \\qty{30}{A}$;", "$P_0 = 1500 \\times 30 = \\qty{45}{kW}$.", "", "\\textbf{20.} 由 $3\\tau_c = \\qty{6.0}{s}$ 得 $\\tau_c = \\qty{2.0}{s}$，故", "$R_c = \\tau_c/C = 2.0/1.78\\times10^{-4} \\approx \\qty{11}{k\\ohm}$，且", "$I_0 = 1500/1.12\\times10^{4} \\approx \\qty{0.13}{A}$ --- 六秒即可", "充好电，只用十分之一安培的电流。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}